Scope of this repository
-------------------------
This repository contains only the deployment configuration required to
install HOPE MTP — the Metahuman Training Platform bundled with the HOPE
Metahuman Service — from Google Cloud Marketplace via the command line: the
umbrella Helm chart, the vendored HOPE Metahuman Service Helm chart, the
Marketplace parameter schema, the deployer's container build files, the
deployment guide, and this documentation. It does not contain the source code
of either application, which remains proprietary to CornerstoneX and is
distributed exclusively as container images through Google Cloud Marketplace
under the HOPE MTP commercial license agreement.

